      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是一名香水的调香师。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F4E00540D99996C3476848C0399995E083002001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "目前在用粉香香这种宝可梦\n散发出的香气制作香水。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76EE524D572875287C89999999998FD979CD5B9D53EF68A6000A656353D151FA768499996C1452364F5C99996C343002001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "粉香香散发的香气\n会根据它所吃的食物而改变。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C8999999999656353D1768499996C14000A4F1A6839636E5B8362405403768498DF7269800C653953D83002001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而这次我想让粉香香吃的是，\n各式各样的树果！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C8FD96B21621160F38BA97C899999999954037684662FFF0C000A54045F0F5404683776846811679CFF01001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "具体内容是\n20个樱子果、<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n5个茄番果，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n还有5个巧可果！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51774F5351855BB9662F000A003200304E2A6A315B50679C300100100001BE00000A00354E2A8304756A679CFF0C00100001BE00000A8FD8670900354E2A5DE753EF679CFF01001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "噗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5657FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是啊，\n我现在有点烦恼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F554AFF0C000A621173B05728670970B970E6607C3002001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是在街上闻到了各种气味，\n就会让我难以顺利地进行调制！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F572888574E0A95FB52304E86540479CD6C145473FF0C000A5C314F1A8BA9621196BE4EE5987A522957308FDB884C8C035236FF01001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以就请你替我去准备树果吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55C318BF74F6066FF621153BB51C659076811679C5427FF01001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是你能在城市里回收，\n或在店铺购买大量的树果给我就太棒了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4F6080FD572857CE5E0291CC56DE6536FF0C000A621657285E9794FA8D2D4E70592791CF76846811679C7ED962115C31592A68D24E86FF01001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请让给我20个樱子果、\n5个茄番果，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n还有5个巧可果。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF78BA97ED96211003200304E2A6A315B50679C3001000A00354E2A8304756A679CFF0C00100001BE00000A8FD8670900354E2A5DE753EF679C3002001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "噗噗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56575657FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请让给我20个樱子果、\n5个茄番果，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n还有5个巧可果。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF78BA97ED96211003200304E2A6A315B50679C3001000A00354E2A8304756A679CFF0C00100001BE00000A8FD8670900354E2A5DE753EF679C3002001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我就收下这20个樱子果、\n5个茄番果，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n还有5个巧可果啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362115C3165364E0B8FD9003200304E2A6A315B50679C3001000A00354E2A8304756A679CFF0C00100001BE00000A8FD8670900354E2A5DE753EF679C5566FF01001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有这么多树果，\n气味也会混在一起变得更复杂吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67098FD94E48591A6811679CFF0C000A6C1454734E5F4F1A6DF757284E008D7753D85F9766F4590D674254273002001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "顺带一提，我让你收集的\n都是些带辣味的树果。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n这次我打算制作辛辣系的香水。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "987A5E264E0063D0FF0C62118BA94F60653696C67684000A90FD662F4E9B5E268FA3547376846811679C300200100001BE00000A8FD96B21621162537B9752364F5C8F9B8FA37CFB768499996C343002001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "粉噗～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C895657FF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "粉香香你怎么了？\n我无法理解你为什么生气啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C89999999994F60600E4E484E86FF1F000A621165E06CD5740689E34F604E3A4EC04E48751F6C14554A3002001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "莫非是因为\n树果的数量太多了？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "83AB975E662F56E04E3A000A6811679C7684657091CF592A591A4E86FF1F001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "粉噗～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C895657FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但你也想知道自己的身体\n会发出什么样的新香气吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F464F604E5F60F377E5905381EA5DF176848EAB4F53000A4F1A53D151FA4EC04E486837768465B099996C145427FF1F001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "粉噗～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C895657FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我明白了！让我们找出\n能摄取这么多树果的方法吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211660E767D4E86FF018BA962114EEC627E51FA000A80FD644453D68FD94E48591A6811679C768465B96CD55427FF01001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "从密阿雷市消失了的名店果汁馆……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECE5BC6963F96F75E026D8859314E867684540D5E97679C6C41998620262026001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果是在那里工作过的人，\n就能把樱子果做成红色果汁，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n让粉香香能够喝下去了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C662F572890A391CC5DE54F5C8FC776844EBAFF0C000A5C3180FD628A6A315B50679C505A62107EA28272679C6C41FF0C00100001BE00000A8BA97C899999999980FD591F559D4E0B53BB4E86FF01001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "粉噗～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C895657FF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多亏了你，我在制作香水上\n有了更多的可能性！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n这是给你的谢礼！\n请收下这些内敛薄荷和经验糖果吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
